    },
    {
      "id": "277:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你不能让亚历克斯把一切抛到脑后。你试着恳求她。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63218:63243"
    },
    {
      "id": "277:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“值得。我们还有彼此。求你了，亚历克斯！”泪水从你脸上滑落。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63243:63275"
    },
    {
      "id": "277:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次困难难度的说服检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63275:63291"
    },
    {
      "id": "277:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 276。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63291:63307"
    },
    {
      "id": "277:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 229。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63307:63323"
    }
  ]
}
